.TH PSYCHI 1 "November 2, 2026" "QLogo @PROJECT_VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
Psychi \- graphical terminal for QLogo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B Psychi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Psychi
is the graphical terminal for the QLogo interpreter.
It provides a command line, a text editor, and a turtle graphics window.
.B Psychi
runs
.BR qlogo (1)
to execute Logo programs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qlogo (1)
